        <mxCell id="ov_teach" value="&lt;b&gt;Summary&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Like a kitchen pass: tickets are checked before anything hits the stove.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;The host verifies the plan, then schedules work so the guest only runs after checks pass. &lt;code&gt;path/to/file.ext:12&lt;/code&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Unsafe work must not start until the control plane has a trusted plan." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=8;fillColor=#F7F7F2;strokeColor=#6B6B6B;fontColor=#1A1A1A;fontSize=13;" vertex="1" parent="1">
