        <mxCell id="ov_summary" value="&lt;b&gt;要点 / Key findings&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;1. Plain finding sentence with no inline cite mixed in.&lt;br&gt;&lt;code&gt;path/to/file.ext:12&lt;/code&gt;&lt;br&gt;2. Second finding in plain language.&lt;br&gt;&lt;code&gt;path/to/other.ext:34-40&lt;/code&gt;&lt;br&gt;3. Third finding explaining the answer shape for a newcomer.&lt;br&gt;&lt;code&gt;path/to/third.ext:50&lt;/code&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=8;fillColor=#F7F7F2;strokeColor=#6B6B6B;fontColor=#1A1A1A;fontSize=13;" vertex="1" parent="1">
