        <mxCell id="fl_note" value="&lt;b&gt;Summary&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Like a ticket check at a kitchen pass: nothing cooks until the order is valid.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;The flow creates a plan, validates it, then either applies it to Success or exits as failed. Evidence ids point to the Impl map; cites may also appear here as &lt;code&gt;path/to/plan.py:40&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Unsafe work must not start until validation accepts the plan." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=8;fillColor=#F7F7F2;strokeColor=#6B6B6B;fontColor=#1A1A1A;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1">
